  - "GNK 13.7x vs SBLK 7.2x at ~equal P/NAV: genuine as printed"
  - "MPCC P/NAV prints blank (—) in the table: confirms the APPROX roster fix (WORKFLOWS step 3 now lists NAT/ASC/CCEC/MPCC)"
